OL,3,GNEWSACattle cull was lawful but there
OL,4,Awere operational shortcomings, review
OL,5,Afinds
OL,6,
OL,7,FA cull of 51 cattle in fields near
OL,8,FFivemiletown in June was lawful and
OL,9,Fappropriate, but operational
OL,10,Fshortcomings existed, according to an
OL,11,Findependent review.
OL,13,FThe report found that there was
OL,14,Finsufficient thought given, when
OL,15,Fplanning the operation, to the visual
OL,16,Fand emotional upset felt by people who
OL,17,Fsaw carcasses lying overnight exposed
OL,18,Fin open fields.
OL,20,FIreland's former chief veterinary
OL,21,Fofficer Dr Martin Blake carried out a
OL,22,Freview of the operation.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
