OL,3,GNEWSACattle cull was lawful but there
OL,4,Awere operational shortcomings, review
OL,5,Afinds
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Agriculture Minister Andrew Muir
OL,8,Fsaid the reports findings are "accepted
OL,9,Fin full with regular reporting and
OL,10,Findependent oversight put in place to
OL,11,Fensure improvements are driven and
OL,12,Fsustained at pace".
